e saved state kept beside the pod, to check it is intact when the pod opens.","kept.readBack":"Reading the saved answers back in when the pod opens.","kept.readBack.restore":"Restoring the saved answers into memory. Sits inside kept.readback.","union.drop":"Dropping facts from the pod's in-memory facts.","union.add":"Adding facts to the pod's in-memory facts.","core-pod.matcherSelect":"A question put to the pod's facts as the 'same record' matcher reads them: the matcher's own, and the one that lists the arrivals it has not taken.","core-pod.step.perform":"Doing the work of one import step: taking in the new records. Sits inside scenario.import.","core-pod.import.documents":"Taking in the documents (notes, reports) that came with the record. Sits inside scenario.import.","arrivals.fileExport":"Taking in every document of the record: converting each, working out its records and writing them to the pod. Sits inside core-pod.step.perform.","core-pod.step.commit":"Writing the step's results to the pod's files and recording that it happened. Sits inside scenario.import.","files.absent.check":"Checking that none of the files a step is about to write is in the pod already: a file whose name fixes its bytes that the pod's listing lacks is new, and any other file, and one the listing has, is read and compared.","scenario.first-answer":"Asking for a first page of the lab results straight after the import, so the screen can be redrawn.","question.page:pod/My lab results":"One page of the answer to: pod my lab results."}}}